flowchart LR
    Start([Approve pilot]) --> P1[Phase 1: Stand up<br/>single-cluster install]
    P1 -->|Install OK| P2[Phase 2: Golden path<br/>author ComponentType]
    P1 -->|Install fails| NoGo[No-Go: Reject]
    P2 --> P3[Phase 3: Self-service<br/>deploy + promote service]
    P3 --> P4[Phase 4: Day-2<br/>upgrade + failure recovery]
    P4 --> Gate{Go / No-Go gate}
    Gate -->|Maintainer can operate<br/>+ dev self-serves| Go[Recommend Adopt → new ADR]
    Gate -->|Too costly| Fallback[Fallback: Backstage + Argo CD]

    style Start fill:#1967d2,color:#fff
    style Go fill:#34a853,color:#fff
    style NoGo fill:#ea4335,color:#fff
    style Fallback fill:#f9ab00,color:#fff
    style Gate fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#1967d2
